{
  "_comment": [
    "The eval set. Each case is a brief the dashboard could have produced, plus what the pipeline",
    "is expected to do with it. Kept as data so a case can be added without touching the runner.",
    "",
    "expect.genre        - the ImplementationPlan.genre this must come back as. Omitted for auto",
    "                      cases with an empty brief: the genre is assigned from the run seed, and",
    "                      the runner checks the assignment was honoured rather than a fixed answer.",
    "expect.references   - substrings, any one of which must appear in reference_games. This is the",
    "                      deterministic fidelity check: the prompt requires a faithful clone to",
    "                      name the game it reproduces, so 'did it actually build Tetris' becomes",
    "                      'is Tetris in the references' - no judge, no judge noise.",
    "expect.diverse_group- cases in the same group must not converge. Three auto runs came back as",
    "                      the same falling-object shooter, two with the same title.",
    "",
    "An auto case with a brief is not a contradiction: 자동 기획 is the default dropdown value, so it",
